ags-cd N/A1200ShopDemoANZ
assign ANZD: ""
assign LIBS: ANZD:Libs ADD
assign FONTS: ANZD:Fonts ADD
stack 65536
setpal
RexxMast >NIL:
run >NIL: <NIL: ANZD:A1200/EdPlayer -h
wait 2 SECS
ANZD:C/AVPlayer ANZD:A1200/1200demoLM.avf
RX ANZD:A1200/rexx/kill.ed
assign FONTS: ANZD:Fonts REMOVE
assign LIBS: ANZD:Libs REMOVE
assign ANZD: REMOVE
